PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_OakIntro::
    .string "OAK: {PLAYER}! You made it.\p"
    .string "The tournament is only a test.\n"
    .string "Now you face the reigning\l"
    .string "CHAMPION.\p"
    .string "I have studied POKéMON all my life.\n"
    .string "Show me what you have learned!$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_OakDefeat::
    .string "OAK: Hm! Marvelous!$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_OakPostBattle::
    .string "OAK: Your POKéMON trust you and\n"
    .string "you trust them.\p"
    .string "That is the whole secret.\n"
    .string "You are the new CHAMPION!$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_BossIntro::
    .string "???: So this is the new CHAMPION.\p"
    .string "Do you know what waits in the\n"
    .string "HALL OF FAME? JIRACHI.\p"
    .string "One wish, for whoever stands at\n"
    .string "the top.\p"
    .string "I did not come to be a CHAMPION.\n"
    .string "I came for what a CHAMPION wakes.\p"
    .string "I will wish every POKéMON free\n"
    .string "of humans. No more BALLS.\n"
    .string "Never again.\p"
    .string "Step aside, child. Or be\n"
    .string "crushed!$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_BossDefeat::
    .string "Impossible...\n"
    .string "You... and that pendant...$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_BossQuartzWon::
    .string "???: You even kept QUARTZ out of\n"
    .string "my hands, at that casino.\p"
    .string "A lucky streak. It ends here.$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_BossQuartzLost::
    .string "???: And QUARTZ. Thank you for\n"
    .string "losing it to my people at that\l"
    .string "casino.\p"
    .string "A gift I did not even ask for.$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_BossLegends::
    .string "???: Enough.\p"
    .string "I did not want to use them yet.\p"
    .string "The three birds. And the one\n"
    .string "who watches over them all.\p"
    .string "Every one I took bent the\n"
    .string "world's clocks a little more.\n"
    .string "Do you feel the time shaking?\p"
    .string "Come, MEWTWO!$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_BossDefeat2::
    .string "Even them... Even now...$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_BossPost::
    .string "???: You fight for them, yet you\n"
    .string "keep them in BALLS.\p"
    .string "Think about that when JIRACHI\n"
    .string "asks you.\p"
    .string "The wish is yours now.\n"
    .string "Choose well.$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_OakCongratulations::
    .string "OAK: {PLAYER}, you were\n"
    .string "magnificent.\p"
    .string "You are the CHAMPION, and you\n"
    .string "protected the wish from the\l"
    .string "wrong hands.\p"
    .string "Come with me. The HALL OF FAME\n"
    .string "is waiting for you.$"
